## Subcommand: `/phase-check kills`

Check kill criteria specifically:
- Read phase-gates.json `started_at` timestamps
- Calculate months elapsed
- Compare against kill thresholds
- Output GO / WARNING / KILL status for each criterion

## Subcommand: `/phase-check <N>`

Show detailed view of a single phase including:
- All hard gate metrics
- Todo list status
- Success criteria checklist
- Risk assessment current state
